# <type>(<scope>): <imperative, lowercase, <=72 chars, no period>
#
# type:  feat|fix|chore|test|docs|refactor|ci|build|perf
# scope: identity|gateway|infra|k8s|repo
#
# --- body (after a blank line, wrap at 72 characters) ---
# Required if the commit:
#   * changes the database schema
#       -> list affected tables/indexes and explain any non-obvious decisions
#   * introduces a security-related change
#       -> describe the threat, the chosen approach, and the accepted trade-offs
#   * contains rationale that cannot be inferred from the diff
#   * introduces a breaking change
#       -> footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# Refs: docs/adr/NNNN-....md